description:
Self-Cleaning Anti-Static Massage Comb:-
Innovative massage particles, each one-pull clean massage comb has small round particles, which can massage the scalp and treat the hair gently, providing a comfortable spa-like experience.
 	Ergonomic Comb:-
The shape of the Self Cleaning Hairbrush conforms to the ergonomic handle. It has a better carding feeling. Every carding is enjoyable.
 	Easy to Use:-
One-pull Clean Massage Comb Just rotate the handle and the airbag will immediately release all hair and debris! The easy-to-use handle ensures that it does not slip out of your hand.
 	Suitable for All Hair Types:-
One-pull Clean Massage Comb with Retractable Bristles Gently penetrate and untie even the most stubborn tangles. This comb is perfect for various hair types, including straight, curly, fine, thick, damaged, and even extended hair.

